    "tournamentNames": "All five exactly match current ESPN event names under tour + espnId. ATP and WTA China Open intentionally share an ESPN event ID.",
    "atpOfficialDifferences": "Official shortened labels and given/family name order explain the eight comparison differences. All 64 live ATP entrants match ESPN and resolve to model inventory. No production aliases inferred from PDF truncation.",
